      "text": "ESCAPADE is an epic interplanetary mission that may inform future spaceflight to the Red Planet. \n\nOur team has been dedicated to making the science mission a success for more than four years.\n\nOur twin spacecraft – Blue & Gold – are about to fire their engines to execute a trans-Mars Injection maneuver to propel themselves to Mars.\n\nRead more about our commitment and contribution to this science mission for @NASA & @ucbssl here: https://rocketlabcorp.com/missions/escapade/\n\nWant to make interplanetary history with us? Our Space Systems team is hiring. See all open positions here: https://rocketlabcorp.com/careers/",
