      "text": "✅ Neutron’s Stage 1 Forward Dome has been built and cured.\n\nThe dome has come off the AFP machine as planned and completed its heat and pressure processing cycle to cure the carbon composite material. \n\nNext step: analysis and material tests to confirm quality and strength, before it moves to the next phase of Stage 1 tank assembly.",
